{"title":"Turkish Olympiad","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Turkish_Olympiad\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Turkish Olympiad</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Rounds_of_Competition\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rounds of Competition</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Categories_&amp;_Rules\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Categories &amp; Rules</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Turkish_Language_Test\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Turkish Language Test</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Singing_Competition\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Singing Competition</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Poetry_Competition\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Poetry Competition</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Folklore_Competition\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Folklore Competition</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Other_Categories\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Categories</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#External_Links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External Links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Turkish_Olympiad\"><b>Turkish Olympiad</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Turkish_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Turkish Olympiad\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Turkish Olympiad is a contest which tests skills learned when learning the Turkish language. There are different categories which test how much was learned and understood about the aspects of Turkish culture. Dates for the International Finals are shown below.\n</p><p><b>2011 International Finals:</b> Turkey, June 2011 \n</p><p><b>2012 International Finals:</b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rounds_of_Competition\">Rounds of Competition</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Turkish_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Rounds of Competition\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>School Elimination\n</p><p>Cluster Elimination\n</p><p>Turkish Olympiad  Elimination\n</p><p>Turkish Olympiad Finals\n</p><p>International Competition\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Categories_.26_Rules\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Categories_&amp;_Rules\">Categories &amp; Rules</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Turkish_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Categories &amp; Rules\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Turkish_Language_Test\">Turkish Language Test</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Turkish_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Turkish Language Test\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Singing_Competition\">Singing Competition</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Turkish_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Singing Competition\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Poetry_Competition\">Poetry Competition</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Turkish_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Poetry Competition\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Folklore_Competition\">Folklore Competition</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Turkish_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Folklore Competition\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Categories\">Other Categories</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Turkish_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Other Categories\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Turkish_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: External Links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.turkceolimpiyatlari.org/\">International Turkish Olympiad</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\